--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 710e1bac7a011e4d458ef6c347ab4156, type: 3}
  m_Name: Call_NelsonIntro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  CallerID: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 09cdebfe05ccaad41adda79be1ca9067, type: 2}
  Stages:
  - Text: Oh shit buddy, good to hear from you! Looks like our luck finally ran out - the cops have got me locked up in a damn cage while I wait for a trial!
    OnStartTriggers: []
    OnDoneTriggers: []
  - Text: Don't feel too sorry for me just yet - I'm afraid you've got some problems of your own. I never had the chance to pay those gang members back in Serena flats. With me in custody, they'll be after you to settle the debt.
    OnStartTriggers: []
    OnDoneTriggers: []
  - Text: The good news is I've managed to sneak a phone in here, so I can help get you back on your feet. Plus, I used to do some business out there in Hyland Point so I've got some old contacts for you.
    OnStartTriggers: []
    OnDoneTriggers: []
  - Text: I've sent your number to some customers to get you started. Take a look around town, there should be everything you need to get back in business.
    OnStartTriggers: []
    OnDoneTriggers: []
  - Text: 'Uh oh, sounds like someones coming. I gotta go. Keep your head up buddy, you''ll hear from me again soon. '
    OnStartTriggers: []
    OnDoneTriggers: []
  onCallCompleted:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
